      "description": "diskutil erase operations DESTROY all data on the target disk or volume.",
      "explanation": "diskutil eraseDisk/eraseVolume/reformat/zeroDisk/randomDisk/secureErase overwrite the target's contents. On APFS this removes every volume in the container. There is no recovery without backups.\n\nInspect the target first: diskutil list diskutil info <disk>",
      "safer_command": "diskutil list",
      "examples": {
        "stop": [
          "diskutil eraseDisk APFS Blank disk4"
        ],
